humbs/abbas-mirza.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Abbas Mirza</span><span class="tp">1789–1833</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alexander-of-greece"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alexander-of-greece.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alexander of Greece</span><span class="tp">1893–1920</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/robert-ley"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/robert-ley.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Robert Ley</span><span class="tp">1890–1945</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/felix-gouin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/felix-gouin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Félix Gouin</span><span class="tp">1884–1977</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gerald-templer"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gerald-templer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gerald Templer</span><span class="tp">1898–1979</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
